            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.41

- Briefing story charts now scale to recent readings, making changes easier to see while retaining a zero baseline and the map's accurate color thresholds.
- Watched cards show each history graph once: when the same reading is already charted in the story above, the card retains its value, direction, reporting week, sources and links without repeating the graph.

These improvements are shared by Mac and iPhone.
]]></description>
